@startuml getLocalProtocol
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLocalProtocol – Retrieve Local TCP Server Protocol
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Server Interface" as tsr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  To retrieve the protocol of the local TCP server.
end note

requestor -> tsr: (none)
activate tsr

tsr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tsr: TCP server LTP list
deactivate jd

note over tsr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate TCP server LTPs
  - Read tcp-server-interface-configuration/protocol  
  - Convert protocol enum to protocol key  
    * HTTP  
    * HTTPS  
    * NOT_YET_DEFINED  
  - Return protocol key  
  - Return undefined if no TCP server exists
end note

tsr --> requestor: protocolKey | undefined
deactivate tsr

@enduml
